  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "DSH ChatGPT Direct",
      "text": "DSH plugin for in-process ChatGPT Codex authorization, model discovery, and account quota. It uses the built-in `llm-pi-ai/openai-codex` transport and DSH credential store. No CLIProxyAPI process is needed for direct sessions."
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH ChatGPT Direct",
      "text": "Install the release package through DSH plugin manager. In Settings → CPA, choose **Add ChatGPT account** to authorize. The plugin adds account-listed models while retaining existing models and the default selection. Select an `openai-codex` model for a conversation to use direct transport. Existing `chatgpt-cpa` sessions remain on their original route until switched."
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH ChatGPT Direct",
      "text": "Quota is an account-level observation, refreshed while the settings page or a direct conversation is visible; it is not a per-model guarantee. Credentials never leave DSH’s credential store except in authorized calls to ChatGPT.\n\nThe interface uses layout patterns from the MIT-licensed DSH OpenCode Go plugin; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md."
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH ChatGPT Direct",
      "text": "Model discovery uses the account endpoint with a minimum tested Codex catalog compatibility version of `0.165.0`. When a local Codex model cache is available, only its newer stable `client_version` is used; no cached models, identity or credentials are imported. Machines without Codex use the bundled compatibility baseline."
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH ChatGPT 直连插件",
      "text": "在 DSH 进程内完成 ChatGPT Codex 授权、模型同步和额度展示。直接会话使用 DSH 自带的 `llm-pi-ai/openai-codex`，无需本地 CLIProxyAPI 服务。\n\n在「设置 → CPA」添加 ChatGPT 账号。模型同步只增补可靠的账号目录条目，保留现有模型与默认选择。会话选择 `openai-codex` 模型后走直连；原 `chatgpt-cpa` 会话在主动切换前维持原路由。\n\n额度是账号级最近观测值，不保证各模型有独立额度。授权由 DSH 凭据服务保管。\n\n模型目录查询最低使用已验证的 Codex 兼容版本 `0.165.0`。若本机有 Codex 模型缓存，只读取其中较新的稳定 `client_version`；模型目录和授权仍来自当前 DSH 账号，不导入其他账号的模型、身份或凭据。未安装 Codex 也可正常使用插件内的兼容版本。"
    }
  ],
